{"chapters":[{"title":"Plain recursion","code":"def unique_paths(m, n):\n    def f(r, c):               # paths from (0, 0) to (r, c)\n        if r == 0 or c == 0:\n            return 1\n        return f(r - 1, c) + f(r, c - 1)\n    return f(m - 1, n - 1)","frames":[{"caption":"<strong>Plain recursion</strong> &mdash; O(2<sup>m+n</sup>) time, O(m + n) extra space. Input: <code>unique_paths(m=3, n=4)</code>. Step through to watch the code work on this input.","line":1,"panels":[],"vars":[["m","3",0],["n","4",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>def f(r, c):</code> <em>(paths from (0, 0) to (r, c))</em>","line":2,"panels":[],"vars":[["m","3",0],["n","4",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return f(m - 1, n - 1)</code> &mdash; calls <code>f(r=2, c=3)</code>","line":6,"panels":[],"vars":[["m","3",0],["n","4",0],["r","2",1],["c","3",1]],"stack":["unique_paths(m=3, n=4)","f(r=2, c=3)"]},{"caption":"<code>if r == 0 or c == 0:</code> &rarr; <strong>false</strong> (c = 3, r = 2)","line":3,"panels":[],"vars":[["m","3",0],["n","4",0],["r","2",0],["c","3",0]],"stack":["unique_paths(m=3, n=4)","f(r=2, c=3)"]},{"caption":"<code>return f(r - 1, c) + f(r, c - 1)</code> &mdash; calls <code>f(r=1, c=3)</code>","line":5,"panels":[],"vars":[["m","3",0],["n","4",0],["r","1",1],["c","3",0]],"stack":["unique_paths(m=3, n=4)","f(r=2, c=3)","f(r=1, c=3)"]},{"caption":"<code>if r == 0 or c == 0:</code> &rarr; <strong>false</strong> (c = 3, r = 1)","line":3,"panels":[],"vars":[["m","3",0],["n","4",0],["r","1",0],["c","3",0]],"stack":["unique_paths(m=3, n=4)","f(r=2, c=3)","f(r=1, c=3)"]},{"caption":"<code>return f(r - 1, c) + f(r, c - 1)</code> &mdash; calls <code>f(r=0, c=3)</code>","line":5,"panels":[],"vars":[["m","3",0],["n","4",0],["r","0",1],["c","3",0]],"stack":["unique_paths(m=3, n=4)","f(r=2, c=3)","f(r=1, c=3)","f(r=0, c=3)"]},{"caption":"<code>if r == 0 or c == 0:</code> &rarr; <strong>true</strong> (c = 3, r = 0)","line":3,"panels":[],"vars":[["m","3",0],["n","4",0],["r","0",0],["c","3",0]],"stack":["unique_paths(m=3, n=4)","f(r=2, c=3)","f(r=1, c=3)","f(r=0, c=3)"]},{"caption":"<code>return 1</code> &mdash; <code>f</code> returns <code>1</code> to <code>f</code>","line":4,"panels":[],"vars":[["m","3",0],["n","4",0],["r","0",0],["c","3",0]],"stack":["unique_paths(m=3, n=4)","f(r=2, c=3)","f(r=1, c=3)","f(r=0, c=3)"]},{"caption":"<code>if r == 0 or c == 0:</code> &rarr; <strong>false</strong> (c = 2, r = 1) &mdash; <code>r = 1</code>; <code>c = 2</code>","line":3,"panels":[],"vars":[["m","3",0],["n","4",0],["r","1",1],["c","2",1]],"stack":["unique_paths(m=3, n=4)","f(r=2, c=3)","f(r=1, c=3)","f(r=1, c=2)"]},{"caption":"<code>return f(r - 1, c) + f(r, c - 1)</code> &mdash; calls <code>f(r=0, c=2)</code>","line":5,"panels":[],"vars":[["m","3",0],["n","4",0],["r","0",1],["c","2",0]],"stack":["unique_paths(m=3, n=4)","f(r=2, c=3)","f(r=1, c=3)","f(r=1, c=2)","f(r=0, c=2)"]},{"caption":"<code>if r == 0 or c == 0:</code> &rarr; <strong>true</strong> (c = 2, r = 0)","line":3,"panels":[],"vars":[["m","3",0],["n","4",0],["r","0",0],["c","2",0]],"stack":["unique_paths(m=3, n=4)","f(r=2, c=3)","f(r=1, c=3)","f(r=1, c=2)","f(r=0, c=2)"]},{"caption":"<code>return 1</code> &mdash; <code>f</code> returns <code>1</code> to <code>f</code>","line":4,"panels":[],"vars":[["m","3",0],["n","4",0],["r","0",0],["c","2",0]],"stack":["unique_paths(m=3, n=4)","f(r=2, c=3)","f(r=1, c=3)","f(r=1, c=2)","f(r=0, c=2)"]},{"caption":"<code>if r == 0 or c == 0:</code> &rarr; <strong>false</strong> (c = 1, r = 1) &mdash; <code>r = 1</code>; <code>c = 1</code>","line":3,"panels":[],"vars":[["m","3",0],["n","4",0],["r","1",1],["c","1",1]],"stack":["unique_paths(m=3, n=4)","f(r=2, c=3)","f(r=1, c=3)","f(r=1, c=2)","f(r=1, c=1)"]},{"caption":"<code>return f(r - 1, c) + f(r, c - 1)</code> &mdash; calls <code>f(r=0, c=1)</code>","line":5,"panels":[],"vars":[["m","3",0],["n","4",0],["r","0",1],["c","1",0]],"stack":["unique_paths(m=3, n=4)","f(r=2, c=3)","f(r=1, c=3)","f(r=1, c=2)","f(r=1,